<title>USA: Zions Bancorp completes Aspen merger.</title>
<headline>Zions Bancorp completes Aspen merger.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY, Utah 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zions Bancorporation said late Friday it had completed its merger with Aspen Bancshares Inc, with a share exchange ratio of one Aspen share for about 0.7387 shares of Zions.</p>
<p>Fractional shares are being paid in cash, the bank said.</p>
<p>The companies had announced a merger deal in November of last year, in which Aspen would be acquired for common shares of Zions.</p>
</text>
